<title>JAPAN: Toda Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toda Kogyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.30		vs	    8.17</p>
<p> Operating    213    million	  vs	  156    million</p>
<p> Current	407    million	  vs	  276    million</p>
<p> Net	    139    million	  vs	   43    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.78 yen	  vs	    0.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     50 million	  vs	  50 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toda Kogyo Corp is a manufacturer of magnetic iron oxide.</p>
